🚆 Online Railway Ticket Reservation System

An Online Railway Ticket Reservation System developed using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Node.js, Express.js, and MySQL. This project provides a simple web-based platform for searching trains, booking tickets, checking booking details, and cancelling reservations.

📌 Project Overview

The Online Railway Ticket Reservation System is designed to simplify the railway ticket booking process through a user-friendly web interface.

Users can search for available trains by entering their source station, destination station, and journey date. They can also book tickets, retrieve booking details using a PNR number, and cancel existing reservations.

✨ Features
🔍 Search trains by source, destination, and journey date.
🎫 Book railway tickets online.
👤 Enter passenger details during booking.
🧾 Generate and retrieve PNR-based booking details.
❌ Cancel existing reservations.
💾 Store train and booking information in a MySQL database.
📱 Simple and user-friendly web interface.
🔗 REST API integration between frontend and backend.
